---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import LeadForm from '../../components/LeadForm.astro';
import { STICKY_VISA } from '../../data/sticky-cta';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Golden Visa Dubai Property: AED 2M Residency Shortlist"
  description="UAE Golden Visa through Dubai property from AED 2M registered value. Off-plan Oqood, mortgage with bank NOC, and multi-unit aggregation explained. Free shortlist."
  stickyCta={STICKY_VISA}
>
  <section class="site-container py-12 md:py-16 max-w-3xl">
    <header class="mb-8">
      <span class="badge-pill mb-4">Golden Visa</span>
      <h1 class="mb-4">Golden Visa through Dubai property</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-[var(--color-muted)]">
        10-year renewable residency, not citizenship. We match properties that qualify on registered value, including off-plan and mortgaged routes where eligible.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-5">
        <a href="#lead-form" class="btn-primary">Get qualifying options</a>
      </p>
    </header>
    <div class="prose mb-10">
      <p><strong>Quick answer:</strong> AED 2M minimum on registered property value (Oqood or title deed). April 2026 rule: full registered value counts even with UAE mortgage if bank NOC provided. Processing typically 2 to 4 weeks in UAE.</p>
      <p>Guide: <a href="/guides/uae-golden-visa-property/">UAE Golden Visa property 2026</a> · <a href="/guides/golden-visa-off-plan-property-uae/">Off-plan eligibility</a></p>
      <p>Moving the whole family: <a href="/uae-expat-documents-property/">expat paperwork to property hub</a></p>
    </div>
    <LeadForm title="Golden Visa property shortlist" subtitle="AED 2M+ · visa-ready options" context="Golden Visa Dubai property landing" />
    <p class="text-xs text-[var(--color-muted)] mt-6">Confirm thresholds with GDRFA/ICP at time of application.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
